It looks like you don't know a healing spell.  My first or second
marker use would probably be a +o(Extra)Healing, depending on charges
and other needs.

Magic markers are the second most powerful item (WoW being the first)
in the game.

If at all possible, identify the charges in the Castle wand *BEFORE*
you zap it.  It is no fun discovering it was (0:1) by wresting with
your 2nd zap.

On the first go-around, exploit *everyting* you can.  Farm those
puddings.  Altar camp.  Dance with foocubi.  Wish up someone-elses
co-aligned quest artifact.  Have your pet Minotaur kill peacefuls.
Break every conduct in the book, and then a few more (for good
measure).

